		{"n-ramble-7", "ugh ok so i tried to return the mushroom lamp and target said no receipt no return, even tho i literally bought it 3 days ago and they can see it on my card. whatever its kinda cute actually jess said she likes it which surprised me. then i went to the post office to forward my mail and the line was out the door so i gave up and did it online which took 5 min, why didnt i just do that first. had a call w my dad about his knee, surgery went fine, he's doing pt now and complaining abt it constantly which means hes back to normal. he wants to come visit in feb after the move, my mom too, so thats like 3 visitors in 2 months between them and my cousin. need a real guest bed or at least a good air mattress. adding that to the list. also the new laptop came!! its so fast i forgot what a computer is supposed to feel like. spent like 2 hours setting it up and moving files and the recovered photos from last summer are all there, the beach trip ones, so happy", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"n-ramble-8", "book club update, we picked the salt book officially, mira hosted again and made this insane baked brie. sofia and i walked home together, she lives like 3 blocks from the new place so we're gonna do farmers market sundays. the nurse in the group is moving to denver which is sad she was the funniest. we're gonna do a goodbye dinner for her in january at that tapas place on valencia. also someone brought up doing a book club trip to a cabin in the summer which sounds amazing but also like herding cats. i said id help plan if it happens. then got home and the downstairs guy had left a THIRD note, this time abt my music, which was not even loud it was a podcast. i'm just gonna bake him cookies and kill him w kindness for my last 3 weeks here. or not. we'll see", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-avatar", "file:~/Pictures/satchel-test/real/01-avatar-cartoon.png", "tapback", ""}, ¬
		{"r-dinner", "file:~/Pictures/satchel-test/real/02-indian-dinner-naan-curry.jpg||dinner last night 🤤", "tapback", ""}, ¬
		{"r-scoreboard", "file:~/Pictures/satchel-test/real/03-sixers-arena-scoreboard.jpg", "tapback", ""}, ¬
