		{"r-video", "file:~/Pictures/satchel-test/real/09-video.mov||!!!", "tapback", ""}, ¬
		{"r-ramble-1", "ok so this week has been a blur. monday was all meetings, tuesday i actually got to design stuff for once which was nice, wednesday the onboarding demo went ok, lena said it was a good first pass which i think is a compliment from her. thursday i had the dentist and they said i need to floss more which everyone says. friday i was so tired i went to bed at 9 like a grandma. the weekend was better, saturday i went to the farmers market with sofia again and bought way too many apples, and sunday i just cleaned and packed and watched a movie about a heist that made no sense but was fun. also my sister sent me like 40 pictures of the twins in their halloween costumes from last year bc she's making a photo book, they were dinosaurs obviously. i need to start planning christmas stuff for real, i keep saying that", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-ramble-2", "random but i've been trying to get into running again even tho kenji said no running yet, i just did a slow mile on the treadmill and my knee was fine so i'm counting it. dont tell him. also i finally tried the new bubble tea place near work, the brown sugar one is incredible but way too sweet for every day. lena brought in her dog to the office on friday, a corgi named biscuit, and nobody got any work done for an hour. i want a dog so bad. waffles is still available at the shelter i checked. two more weeks till the move. jess and i are going to ikea on saturday for a bookshelf and a rug, pray for us. last time i went to ikea i got lost for 45 min and bought 6 candles and a plant i killed", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-ramble-3", "the downstairs guy left a fourth note lol. this one said my 'heavy walking' was disturbing his meditation. i literally wear socks. i'm going to miss the couple across the hall though, they're giving us a housewarming plant which is so sweet. work update: hired the new engineer!! her name is priya k (different priya lol) and she starts in january. interviewing was so stressful but lena said i did well. also the client finally agreed to push the dashboard to march which is a huge relief. went climbing with dana on tuesday and i finally finished the purple route i've been stuck on for a month, i literally screamed. the gym guy gave me a high five", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-ramble-4", "thinking about new years plans. jess wants to throw a party at the new place but we won't even have furniture yet lol. maybe we go to dana's friend's thing instead, she said it's in a warehouse with a dj. or just stay in and watch the ball drop like old people. i also want to make some actual resolutions this year: read 20 books, cook 3 nights a week, call grandma every sunday, and maybe learn some basic spanish before the portugal trip even tho they speak portuguese, i know, but its a start. my mom wants everyone home for new years day brunch too, she's making her famous french toast casserole", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-ramble-5", "ok weird night. went to a friend's birthday dinner at this korean bbq place and the table had like 14 people so it took forever to order. the food was amazing though, the short rib was insane. then a bunch of us went to karaoke and i sang a song i will not name. got home at 1am which is way past my bedtime now. also found out my coworker who sits next to me is moving to london in the spring for her husband's job which is sad, she's the one who always has snacks. need to find a new snack source. oh and the movers emailed confirming jan 2 and asked for the elevator reservation at the new building, need to ask mr patel about that", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-ramble-6", "last thing for tonight. made a list of all the stuff i need for the new kitchen bc jess and i realized we have 2 can openers and 0 good knives between us. need: a real chef knife, a cutting board that isnt warped, a dutch oven (or keep borrowing jess's lol), a colander, and those glass containers for meal prep. budget is like 200 total. also i want a nice coffee setup since the old place had the coffee machine that came with the apartment. jess says we can split it. ok goodnight for real", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-q-game", "that game i went to", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-q-score", "what was the score", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-q-dinner", "the dinner", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-q-arch", "that building with the arch", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-q-video", "the video i sent", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-q-player", "who was that player", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-q-furry", "the furry guy pic", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-q-cartoon", "the cartoon one", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-q-cafe", "that cafe pic", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-q-posters", "the nerdy posters", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-ramble-7", "ok so update on the kitchen stuff, went to the restaurant supply store downtown w jess and its like a warehouse of every kitchen thing ever. got a real chef knife for 45 bucks which is a steal apparently, a huge cutting board, and a colander. jess got a cast iron pan which she is now obsessed with seasoning, she watched like 4 videos about it. we also found a cheap dutch oven so i can stop borrowing hers. total was 140 so under budget!! then we got pho at the place next door and talked about how to split the bills at the new place, we're gonna use a shared card for groceries and venmo for everything else. feeling very adult. also my mom called to say she booked her flight for february, she lands on the 6th at like 2pm so i need to pick her up from the airport", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-ramble-8", "work was chaotic today, the client called an emergency meeting bc they saw a competitor launch something similar to what we're building and now they want to 'accelerate'. lena handled it really well tho, she basically said we'll show them a demo next week and then decide. i spent the afternoon making mockups for it. priya k (the new hire) sent me a nice email saying she's excited to start which made my day. also the coffee machine is fixed!!! the whole floor cheered. small wins. after work i went to pottery and glazed my bowl, it's gonna be blue, firing takes a week so i'll see it next wednesday. fingers crossed it doesnt crack in the kiln", "text", ""}, ¬
		{"r-ramble-9", "sunday reset. did laundry, cleaned the bathroom, packed 4 more boxes (books mostly, i own too many books), and meal prepped chicken and rice for the week. called grandma like i promised, she told me the same story about her first car three times but i didn't mind. she's doing good, her friend from church drives her to the store now. then i went for a walk in the park and saw like 10 dogs and wanted every single one. waffles update: still at the shelter, i checked again, i might go visit him next weekend just to say hi. jess says that's how you end up adopting a dog the same day. she's probably right", "text", ""}, ¬
